  "description": "A modern WPF color picker UserControl for .NET 8. HSV color wheel, RGB/HSL sliders, hex input, opacity support, recent colors, standard palettes, and eyedropper. Lightweight, themeable via DynamicResources, zero external dependencies. Drop-in ready for any WPF application.",
