  "releaseNotes": "2.0.3 — Localization StaticResource fixes: DynamicResource → StaticResource on localization keys across all color picker panels; localized dictionary wiring hardened. No public API changes — drop-in upgrade from 2.0.2. 2.0.2 — +10 new localizations (28 total); Phase 5 self-contained NuGet localization fix. 2.0.1 — HSV color wheel + RGB/HSL sliders + opacity + recent colors + eyedropper + DynamicResource theming.",
